---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects & Examples
description: "Representative examples of Bondar Labs work — FDM, resin, file support and small-batch production. Real-world projects vary; request a quote for an accurate spec and price."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Bondar Labs · Portfolio</p>
    <h1>Projects & examples</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Representative examples of typical work — what it is, how it’s made, and what mattered.
      Your exact results depend on geometry, material choice and requirements.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/quote/' | url }}">Get a Quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/services/' | url }}">Explore Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for cs in collections.caseStudies %}
        <a class="card card-link" href="{{ cs.url | url }}">
          <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ cs.data.coverImage | url }}" alt="{{ cs.data.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="kicker">{{ cs.data.tech }} · {{ cs.data.material }}</div>
            <h2 class="h3">{{ cs.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="muted">{{ cs.data.summary }}</p>
            {% if cs.data.note %}
              <p class="tiny muted" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ cs.data.note }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
